\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Alignment-training claim}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{alignment}

\p{An \newvocab{alignment-training claim} is a capability claim
#{(M_0,A,E_{\rm align},b)} in the sense of \ref{ftip-0003}. The procedure
#{A} changes model parameters and declares its training observations, loss or
reward, and update rule. The independently fixed criterion #{E_{\rm align}}
states the behavior relative to which the word ``alignment'' is used.}

\p{Calling a procedure alignment training does not assert that its criterion
is complete or that optimizing its training signal improves an independent
evaluation.}
